475281.overview:
A singing, dancing fashion star from the makers of My Talking Tom!

Talking Angela is the super fun virtual star who can’t wait to dance and sing her way to the top.

Players help her stay happy and busy with day-to-day activities in her 3D world:
- Stylish makeup looks
- Wonderful wardrobe choices
- Super sweet activities
- Special sticker albums

She’s interactive. She’s customizable. She’s fun. And she’s always ready to make new friends.

From the creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends comes the pet who’s a star in the making.

This app contains:
- Promotion of Outfit7's products and advertising;
- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;
- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;
- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7's animated characters;
- The option to make in-app purchases;
- Subscriptions which automatically renew unless they are cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of a subscription period. You can manage and cancel your subscription via Settings in your App Store account;
- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;
- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.

475285.overview:
It’s Talking Tom, the virtual pet cat who loves to chat.

Talking Tom is the cat making every day a fun adventure.

Players adopt this virtual pet, keep him happy and help him explore his world.

